0_18\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मुण्डकसमाप्तिपर्यन्तेन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मुण्डक-समाप्ति-पर्यन्तेन</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_19\">ग्रन्थेन</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_20\"><span class=\"bhsj\">गुरुराहेत्याह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">गुरुः आह इति आह</span></span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_21\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदेतदक्षरं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् एतत् अक्षरम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_22\">सत्यमित्यादिना</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_23\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_24\"><span class=\"bhsj\">षष्ठाध्यायसमाप्तिपर्यन्तेन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">षष्ठ-अध्याय-समाप्ति-पर्यन्तेन</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_25\">ग्रन्थेन</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_26\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_27\">तत्र</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_28\" data-g=\"anubhuti\" data-flag>ताव</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"2.1.1\" data-lemma=\"तदेतत्सत्यं यथा सुदीप्तात्पावकाद्विस्फुलिङ्गाः सहस्रशः प्रभवन्ते सरूपाः तथाक्षराद्विविधाः सोम्य भावाः प्रजायन्ते तत्र चैवापियन्ति\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:0\" data-jpinw=\"तत्\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_29\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदेतत्सत्यं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् एतत् सत्यम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_30\">यथा</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_31\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सुदीप्तात्पावकाद्विस्फुलिङ्गाः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सुदीप्तात् पावकात् विस्फुलिङ्गाः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_32\">सहस्रशः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_33\">प्रभवन्ते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_34\">सरूपाः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_35\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_36\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तथाक्षराद्विविधाः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तथा अक्षरात् विविधाः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_37\">सोम्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_38\">भावाः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_39\">प्रजायन्ते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_40\">तत्र</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_41\"><span class=\"bhsj\">चैवापियन्ति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">च एव अपियन्ति</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_42\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_43\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मन्त्रं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मन्त्रम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_44\">व्याचष्टे</span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_45\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तदेतदक्षरमिति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तत् एतत् अक्षरम् इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_46\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_47\">५१</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.1:tanubhuti_0_48\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div></div></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"anubhuti\" data-label=\"अनुभूतिप्रकाशः\"><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।५२ · मु २।१।२</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अक्षरात्मा</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अक्षर-आत्मा</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_1\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्वयं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्वयम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ज्योतिर्मायारूपाक्षरात्परः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ज्योतिः माया-रूप-अक्षरात् परः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_3\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_4\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अचिन्त्यशक्तिरनृता</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अचिन्त्य-शक्तिः अनृता</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मायाऽस्मिन्कल्पयेज्जगत्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">माया अस्मिन् कल्पयेत् जगत्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_6\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_7\">५२</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_8\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"2.1.2\" data-lemma=\"दिव्योह्यमूर्त्तः पुरुषः स बाह्याभ्यन्तरो ह्यजः अप्राणो ह्यमनाः शुभ्रोह्यक्षरात्परतः पर\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:0\" data-jpinw=\"दिव्यः\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_9\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दिव्योह्यमूर्त्तः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दिव्यः हि अमूर्त्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_10\">पुरुषः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_11\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_12\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाह्याभ्यन्तरो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाह्य-अभ्यन्तरः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_13\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ह्यजः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">हि अजः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_14\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_15\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अप्राणो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अप्राणः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_16\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ह्यमनाः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">हि अमनाः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_17\"><span class=\"bhsj\">शुभ्रोह्यक्षरात्परतः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">शुभ्रः हि अक्षरात् परतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_18\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पर</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परः</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_19\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_20\">मन्त्रस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_21\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तात्पर्यमाह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तात्पर्यम् आह</span></span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_22\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अक्षरात्मेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अक्षर-आत्मा इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_23\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_24\">५२</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_25\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div>","<div class=\"side-zone\" data-side=\"anubhuti\"><div class=\"zlabel\">अनुभूतिप्रकाशः</div><div class=\"tika dv\"><div class=\"tk\"><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।५२ · मु २।१।२</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अक्षरात्मा</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अक्षर-आत्मा</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_1\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स्वयं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">स्वयम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ज्योतिर्मायारूपाक्षरात्परः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ज्योतिः माया-रूप-अक्षरात् परः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_3\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_4\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अचिन्त्यशक्तिरनृता</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अचिन्त्य-शक्तिः अनृता</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मायाऽस्मिन्कल्पयेज्जगत्</span><span class=\"bhsp\">माया अस्मिन् कल्पयेत् जगत्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_6\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_7\">५२</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_8\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"2.1.2\" data-lemma=\"दिव्योह्यमूर्त्तः पुरुषः स बाह्याभ्यन्तरो ह्यजः अप्राणो ह्यमनाः शुभ्रोह्यक्षरात्परतः पर\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:0\" data-jpinw=\"दिव्यः\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_9\"><span class=\"bhsj\">दिव्योह्यमूर्त्तः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">दिव्यः हि अमूर्त्तः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_10\">पुरुषः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_11\"><span class=\"bhsj\">स</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_12\"><span class=\"bhsj\">बाह्याभ्यन्तरो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">बाह्य-अभ्यन्तरः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_13\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ह्यजः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">हि अजः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_14\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_15\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अप्राणो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अप्राणः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_16\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ह्यमनाः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">हि अमनाः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_17\"><span class=\"bhsj\">शुभ्रोह्यक्षरात्परतः</span><span class=\"bhsp\">शुभ्रः हि अक्षरात् परतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_18\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पर</span><span class=\"bhsp\">परः</span></span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_19\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_20\">मन्त्रस्य</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_21\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तात्पर्यमाह</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तात्पर्यम् आह</span></span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_22\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अक्षरात्मेति</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अक्षर-आत्मा इति</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_23\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_24\">५२</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.2:tanubhuti_0_25\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div></div></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"anubhuti\" data-label=\"अनुभूतिप्रकाशः\"><span class=\"tk-grp\" data-jgrp=\"7\" data-gs=\"anubhuti\"></span><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।५३ · मु २।१।३–९</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मायाविनोऽस्मात्प्राणादि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मायाविनः अस्मात् प्राण-आदि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_1\">वियदादि</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_2\">च</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_3\">जायते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ततो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ततः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_6\">विराडभूत्तस्मिन्नवशिष्टम</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_7\">भूज्जगत्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_8\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_9\">५३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_10\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_11\">इदानीम्</span></span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"2.1.9\" data-lemma=\"एतस्माज्जायते प्राणो मनः सर्वेन्द्रियाणि चे\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:2.1.3:0\" data-jpinw=\"एतस्मात्\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:2.1.3:0\">“ <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_12\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एतस्माज्जायते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एतस्मात् जायते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_13\"><span class=\"bhsj\">प्राणो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">प्राणः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_14\">मनः</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_15\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सर्वेन्द्रियाणि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सर्व-इन्द्रियाणि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_16\">चे</span>\"</span><span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_17\">त्यादिम्</span> , ,</span> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"2.1.9\" data-lemma=\"अतश्च सर्वा ओषधयोरसश्च येनैष भूतैस्तिष्ठते ह्यन्तरात्मे\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:9\" data-jpinw=\"अतः\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:9\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_18\"><span class=\"bhsj\">अतश्च</span><span class=\"bhsp\">अतः च</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_19\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सर्वा</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सर्वाः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_20\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ओषधयोरसश्च</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ओषधयः रसः च</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_21\">येनैष</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_22\"><span class=\"bhsj\">भूतैस्तिष्ठते</span><span class=\"bhsp\">भूतैः तिष्ठते</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_23\">ह्यन्तरात्मे</span> \"</span> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_24\">त्यन्तं</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_25\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ग्रन्थं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ग्रन्थम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_26\">व्याचष्टे</span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_27\"><span class=\"bhsj\">माया</span><span class=\"bhsp\">माया-</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_28\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विनः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_29\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_30\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_31\">५३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_32\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div>","<div class=\"side-zone\" data-side=\"anubhuti\"><div class=\"zlabel\">अनुभूतिप्रकाशः</div><div class=\"tika dv\"><div class=\"tk\"><span class=\"tk-grp\" data-jgrp=\"7\" data-gs=\"anubhuti\"></span><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।५३ · मु २।१।३–९</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">मायाविनोऽस्मात्प्राणादि</span><span class=\"bhsp\">मायाविनः अस्मात् प्राण-आदि</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_1\">वियदादि</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_2\">च</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_3\">जायते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ततो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ततः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_6\">विराडभूत्तस्मिन्नवशिष्टम</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_7\">भूज्जगत्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_8\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_9\">५३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_10\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-vy\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.