i_0_25\"><span class=\"bhsj\">ग्रन्थं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">ग्रन्थम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_26\">व्याचष्टे</span> - <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_27\"><span class=\"bhsj\">माया</span><span class=\"bhsp\">माया-</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_28\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विन</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विनः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_29\">इति</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_30\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_31\">५३</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.9:tanubhuti_0_32\">॥</span></span> </div></details></div></div></div>","<div class=\"tk-inline\" data-side=\"anubhuti\" data-label=\"अनुभूतिप्रकाशः\"><span class=\"ap-hd\">श्लोकाः ६।५४ · मु २।१।१०</span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_0\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पुरुषो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पुरुषः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_1\">मायया</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_2\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सर्वजगद्रूपेण</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सर्व-जगत्-रूपेण</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_3\">भासते</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_4\">।</span></span> <span class=\"ap-sl\"><span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_5\"><span class=\"bhsj\">सर्वं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">सर्वम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_6\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पुरुष</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पुरुषः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_7\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एवातो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एव अतः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_8\"><span class=\"bhsj\">वस्तुतत्त्वावलोकने</span><span class=\"bhsp\">वस्तु-तत्त्व-अवलोकने</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_9\">॥</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_10\">५४</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_11\">॥</span></span> <details class=\"ap-tk\"><summary>मितप्रकाशविवृतिः</summary><div class=\"ap-tkb\"> <span class=\"tk-prat\" data-jb=\"2.1.10\" data-lemma=\"पुरुष एवेदं विश्वं कर्म तपो ब्रह्म परामृतम् एतद्यो वेद निहितं गुहायां सो विद्याग्रन्थिं विकिरतीह सोम्ये\" data-jmo=\"1\" data-jpin=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:0\" data-jpinw=\"पुरुषः\" data-jmt=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:0\">\" <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_12\"><span class=\"bhsj\">पुरुष</span><span class=\"bhsp\">पुरुषः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_13\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एवेदं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एव इदम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_14\"><span class=\"bhsj\">विश्वं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">विश्वम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_15\">कर्म</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_16\"><span class=\"bhsj\">तपो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">तपः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_17\">ब्रह्म</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_18\">परामृतम्</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_19\">।</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_20\"><span class=\"bhsj\">एतद्यो</span><span class=\"bhsp\">एतत् यः</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_21\">वेद</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_22\"><span class=\"bhsj\">निहितं</span><span class=\"bhsp\">निहितम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_23\"><span class=\"bhsj\">गुहायां</span><span class=\"bhsp\">गुहायाम्</span></span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_24\" data-g=\"anubhuti\" data-flag>सो</span> <span class=\"w\" data-k=\"Mundaka:2.1.10:tanubhuti_0_25\">विद्याग्र